# UNDERDELVE: the smith's way into the headframe, by buttons alone (only
# the 500 ore is set up). From the camp, up its ladder into the old pump
# room; a hop through the plank under the pump room's ladder and up again to
# the rafters; east along them to the smith's camp. Pay him, climb to the
# hammer loft, and walk east through the broken wall and round the wrap onto
# the headframe walk, inside the tower.
game underdelve
wait 15
cheat no_gloom
cheat money 500
expect room_x == 6
expect room_y == 3
hold RIGHT 48
expect px == 83
hold UP 230
expect room_x == 6
expect room_y == 2
expect py == 130
expect grounded == 1
hold RIGHT 122
hold A 3
wait 40
expect px == 205
expect py == 98
hold UP 230
expect room_x == 6
expect room_y == 1
expect grounded == 1
hold RIGHT 200
expect room_x == 7
expect room_y == 1
press UP
wait 5
expect hammer == 1
expect money == 0
hold RIGHT 72
hold UP 230
expect room_x == 7
expect room_y == 0
expect grounded == 1
hold RIGHT 200
expect room_x == 0
expect room_y == 0
expect deaths == 0
expect lanterns == 6
